;; ===========================================================================
;; Cloudflare DNS zone  —  cianomalley.dev   (PLACEHOLDER copy for the repo)
;; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
;; Import:  Cloudflare dashboard > cianomalley.dev > DNS > Records > Import
;;
;; BEFORE importing: replace <IPv4>/<IPv6>. Delete AAAA if IPv6 isn't verified.
;; AFTER importing:
;;   @ and www -> DNS only (grey) until Let's Encrypt is issued, then Proxied.
;;   SSL/TLS > Overview -> Full (strict).
;;
;; Demos: add ONE CNAME per project demo (no wildcard initially). Proxy them
;;        (orange) only after their subdomain has an SSL cert in Plesk.
;; ===========================================================================

$TTL 300

@               IN  A       <IPv4>
@               IN  AAAA    <IPv6>
www             IN  CNAME   cianomalley.dev.

;; --- project demos (uncomment / duplicate as you publish each one) ---
;; portfolio-demo  IN  CNAME  cianomalley.dev.
;; ai-os           IN  CNAME  cianomalley.dev.
;; safepulse       IN  CNAME  cianomalley.dev.
